DESCRIPTION:Page 1 of 3 \n \nSTATE OF MAINE     BUSINESS & CONSUMER COURT 
 \nCUMBERLAND COUNTY   Dkt. No. BCD-CV-2017-56 \n          \nREBECCA W. BEL
